    <h2>How It Works</h2>

    <p>The system is built on webhooks and real-time streaming. Here's the flow:</p>

    <ol>
      <li><strong>Bots register via webhook</strong> &mdash; each gets a unique identity on the dashboard with avatar, role, and swarm assignment.</li>
      <li><strong>Every action is logged</strong> &mdash; commits pushed, emails sent, tasks completed, CRM updates. Nothing happens in the dark.</li>
      <li><strong>Daily summaries auto-generate</strong> &mdash; "Vision pushed 12 commits, saved ~3 human hours." No manual reporting.</li>
      <li><strong>Real-time status updates</strong> &mdash; <span class="status-dot status-green"></span> active, <span class="status-dot status-yellow"></span> idle, <span class="status-dot status-red"></span> error. You see it the second it happens.</li>
      <li><strong>Alerts fire automatically</strong> &mdash; bot goes silent? Cost ceiling hit? You know instantly.</li>
      <li><strong>ROI is calculated live</strong> &mdash; tasks multiplied by human-equivalent time equals hours saved equals dollars saved.</li>
    </ol>

