    <h2>What Makes This Different</h2>

    <p>No other platform does this.</p>

    <p>Competitors give you one chatbot and call it "AI-powered." GullStack gives you an entire AI department &mdash; organized by team (Engineering, Marketing, Ops), with reporting lines, performance metrics, and real-time oversight.</p>

    <p>It's the difference between "we use AI" and "we manage an AI workforce."</p>

    <p>Every action is auditable. Every cost is visible. Every bot is accountable. If something breaks, you don't find out three days later when a client complains &mdash; you see a red dot and an alert in your queue within seconds.</p>

